{"4968590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Osiedlowy", "steam_appid": 4968590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4969460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968590/extras/be2a78e4914312be7b4a86f6ad535763.avif?t=1787898726\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968590/extras_big/be2a78e4914312be7b4a86f6ad535763.avif?t=1787898726 width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The housing estate has never been a particularly safe place. Now, however, things have completely spiraled out of control.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Osiedlowy</strong> is a fast-paced action roguelite inspired by survivors-style games, set in an absurd world of Polish apartment blocks, courtyards, and neighborhood legends. Choose your hero, grab the strangest weapon you can find, and try to survive wave after wave of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run gives you the opportunity to create a different build. Upgrade your weapons, choose matching items, and discover powerful combinations that can turn ordinary neighborhood objects into tools of mass destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the neighborhood way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget magical swords and legendary artifacts. Here, you fight with slippers, pierogi, garden hoses, carrier pigeons, fries falling from the sky, and many other objects that were never meant to become weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you choose new upgrades and decide how your character develops. Focus on area damage, attack speed, durability, mobility, or experiment with unusual combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair weapons with the right items, upgrade them to their maximum level, and discover special evolutions and combat sets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the residents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable hero has unique traits, a starting weapon, and a distinctive playstyle. Choose the character that best suits the way you fight, or learn to make the most of their strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may also encounter neighborhood pets and companions that can support you in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive new districts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through housing estates, dark forests, forgotten dungeons, crypts, and other locations overrun by increasingly bizarre enemies. Each area introduces its own opponents, dangers, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the stronger the incoming waves become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect bottle caps and grow stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your runs, you collect bottle caps and other resources that can be used to unlock new heroes, upgrades, and additional content. Even defeat can bring you closer to creating a more powerful build in your next attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action roguelite gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An absurd world inspired by Polish housing estates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual weapons, items, and powerful combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied cast of heroes with distinct playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of increasingly powerful and ridiculous enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression and unlockable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense runs designed for repeated play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous, hand-painted visual style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the neighborhood, choose your weapon, and show everyone who really runs the place.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968590/extras/be2a78e4914312be7b4a86f6ad535763.avif?t=1787898726\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4968590/extras_big/be2a78e4914312be7b4a86f6ad535763.avif?t=1787898726 width=1560 height=588 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The housing estate has never been a particularly safe place. Now, however, things have completely spiraled out of control.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Osiedlowy</strong> is a fast-paced action roguelite inspired by survivors-style games, set in an absurd world of Polish apartment blocks, courtyards, and neighborhood legends. Choose your hero, grab the strangest weapon you can find, and try to survive wave after wave of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run gives you the opportunity to create a different build. Upgrade your weapons, choose matching items, and discover powerful combinations that can turn ordinary neighborhood objects into tools of mass destruction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the neighborhood way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget magical swords and legendary artifacts. Here, you fight with slippers, pierogi, garden hoses, carrier pigeons, fries falling from the sky, and many other objects that were never meant to become weapons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each run, you choose new upgrades and decide how your character develops. Focus on area damage, attack speed, durability, mobility, or experiment with unusual combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair weapons with the right items, upgrade them to their maximum level, and discover special evolutions and combat sets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the residents</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable hero has unique traits, a starting weapon, and a distinctive playstyle. Choose the character that best suits the way you fight, or learn to make the most of their strengths and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may also encounter neighborhood pets and companions that can support you in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive new districts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through housing estates, dark forests, forgotten dungeons, crypts, and other locations overrun by increasingly bizarre enemies. Each area introduces its own opponents, dangers, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the stronger the incoming waves become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect bottle caps and grow stronger</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your runs, you collect bottle caps and other resources that can be used to unlock new heroes, upgrades, and additional content. Even defeat can bring you closer to creating a more powerful build in your next attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action roguelite gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An absurd world inspired by Polish housing estates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual weapons, items, and powerful combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied cast of heroes with distinct playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of increasingly powerful and ridiculous enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent progression and unlockable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, intense runs designed for repeated play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A humorous, hand-painted visual style.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the neighborhood, choose your weapon, and show everyone who really runs the place.</strong></p>", "short_description": "You beat a wild boar 